<title>USA: MBIA has capacity for Lehman Brothers bonds.</title>
<headline>MBIA has capacity for Lehman Brothers bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said Monday it has limited insurance capacity for Lehman Brothers Holding and Lehman Brothers Inc bonds maturing through Sept 1, 2000.</p>
<p>Capacity is initially limited to a maximum of $10 million per firm for each name on a first-come, first-served basis, MBIA said.</p>
<p>For more information, call 800-624-2669.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
